<div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">LANGKAH 1 DARI 2</span><h1>Konfirmasi pesanan</h1><p>Pastikan jumlah dan metode pemenuhan pesanan sudah sesuai.</p></div><section class="checkout-grid"><div class="panel"><h2>Ringkasan produk</h2><div class="line-item"><?php if($product['photo_url']): ?><img src="<?= e($product['photo_url']) ?>" alt=""><?php else: ?><div class="mini-food">🍱</div><?php endif; ?><div class="line-main"><strong><?= e($product['name']) ?></strong><span class="muted"><?= e($product['business_name']) ?></span><span><?= (int)$quantity ?> porsi × <?= money(discount_price($product)) ?></span></div><strong><?= money(discount_price($product)*$quantity) ?></strong></div><div class="checkout-note">Harga diskon <?= (int)$product['discount_percent'] ?>% • Batas konsumsi <?= e(date('d M Y',strtotime($product['expiry_date']))) ?></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Metode pemenuhan</h2><form method="post" class="form-stack"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="create_order"><input type="hidden" name="product_id" value="<?= (int)$product['product_id'] ?>"><label>Jumlah porsi<input type="number" name="quantity" min="1" max="<?= (int)$product['available_stock'] ?>" value="<?= min((int)$quantity,(int)$product['available_stock']) ?>" required></label><label>Metode serah-terima<select name="fulfillment_method" id="fulfillment-method"><option value="self-pickup">Ambil sendiri (self-pickup)</option><option value="delivery">Kurir (delivery)</option></select></label><label id="destination-label" class="hidden">Alamat pengiriman<textarea name="destination_address" rows="3" placeholder="Masukkan alamat lengkap"></textarea></label><div class="summary-total"><span>Total produk</span><strong><?= money(discount_price($product)*$quantity) ?></strong></div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-full">Buat pesanan & lanjut pembayaran</button><p class="tiny muted">Pembayaran dan tarif kurir masih disimulasikan dalam versi praktikum.</p></form></div></section>
